= The Sith Strike First

Nobody stops him. The Jedi suspect, but they cannot prove. The Senate fears, but it cannot see. [? if anakin_fallen : Anakin Skywalker, promised the power to save Padmé, kneels before his master and takes a new name: **Darth Vader**. ?][? if not anakin_fallen : Anakin Skywalker, sensing something terribly wrong, refuses the Chancellor's summons and goes to Padmé instead. ?] Darth Sidious prepares to give the order he has waited fifteen years to give.
